nable security for personal data and to use and process such personal data on our behalf only.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">c) ABI may share your personal data with other third parties:\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>to comply with the law, regulatory requests, court orders, subpoena, or legal processes;\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>to verify or enforce compliance with ABI’s policies and agreements; and\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>to protect the rights, property or safety of ABI, its customers, visitors to our Platforms and/or the public.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">d) Other parties in connection with corporate transactions such as a merger, acquisition, sale of assets, joint venture, distribution agreements (e.g.: wholesalers), or any other transaction that results in a change in control or ownership of ABI, in whole or in part.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">Some of these recipients are in territories outside the country where your personal data has been collected, including countries which might not be considered to offer a level of data protection comparable to that of the country where your data has been collected. In such cases, we inform you that, where required under applicable data protection law, we will transfer your data with adequate safeguards to keep your data safe. \\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">Depending on the applicable website, application or service, personal data will be transferred:\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">(a)\\u003Cspan style=\\\"white-space: pre;\\\">\\t\\u003C/span>To countries in which ABI operates; and\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">(b)\\u003Cspan style=\\\"white-space: pre;\\\">\\t\\u003C/span>To countries in which our service providers operate, including Brazil, India, Israel, the Netherlands, and the USA.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cdiv style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/p>\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"20px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"45px\",paddingRight:\"50px\",fontSize:\"20px\",marginLeft:\"1px\"}}},{\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",\"@version\":2,id:\"builder-59dde48265044ad8a6bb2f5d97e61e4a\",meta:{previousId:\"builder-7daa2e2f9621413baafb1d237049384f\"},component:{name:\"Text\",options:{text:\"\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>\\u003Cu>\\u003Col start=\\\"5\\\">\\u003Cli>HOW LONG DO WE RETAIN YOUR PERSONAL DATA FOR?\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ol>\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/u>\\u003C/strong>\\u003C/p>\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"0px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"45px\",paddingRight:\"50px\",fontSize:\"20px\",fontWeight:\"600\",fontFamily:\"\\\"Avantt-Bold\\\", sans-serif\"}}},{\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",\"@version\":2,id:\"builder-7056e4e2dcab4a1da567863c89aa7b27\",meta:{previousId:\"builder-fa34190338b54fd3bc7eacf315aac992\"},component:{name:\"Text\",options:{text:\"\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">For personal data that we collect and process for the purposes outlined, we will typically retain such personal data for as long as it is necessary to fulfil each of these purposes. We will actively review the personal data we hold and delete it securely, or in some cases anonymize it, when there is no longer a legal, business or consumer need for it to be retained. If allowed by the applicable data protection laws, you may have the right to ask us to delete your personal data as explained in the Section below.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/p>\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"-2px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"45px\",paddingRight:\"50px\",fontSize:\"20px\",marginLeft:\"1px\"}}},{\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",\"@version\":2,id:\"builder-9507a4ab2bd840d08aeda02f1b1dfca2\",meta:{previousId:\"builder-59dde48265044ad8a6bb2f5d97e61e4a\"},component:{name:\"Text\",options:{text:\"\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>\\u003Cu>6. WHAT ARE YOU RIGHTS\\u003C/u>\\u003C/strong>\\u003C/p>\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"0px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"45px\",paddingRight:\"50px\",fontSize:\"20px\",fontWeight:\"600\",fontFamily:\"\\\"Avantt-Bold\\\", sans-serif\"}}},{\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",\"@version\":2,id:\"builder-a187cea450d44b6ba40034fab9962c09\",meta:{previousId:\"builder-7056e4e2dcab4a1da567863c89aa7b27\"},component:{name:\"Text\",options:{text:\"\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">Under the conditions set forth under applicable data protection laws, you may have the following rights concerning the processing of your personal data:\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cstrong>Confirmation and information. \\u003C/strong>You may have the right to receive confirmation of the existence of the processing and to obtain information about the public or private entities with which ABI has shared your personal data.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cstrong>Access & Portability. \\u003C/strong>You may have the right to request information on the data we store concerning you as well as the purpose of storage and a copy of the personal data we are processing about you, which we will provide to you in electronic form. At our discretion we may require you to prove your identity before providing the requested information. If you require multiple copies of your personal data, we may charge a reasonable administration fee.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cstrong>Rectification. \\u003C/strong>You may have the right to request that any incomplete or inaccurate personal data that we process about you is amended.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cstrong>Deletion.\\u003C/strong> You may have the right to request that we delete personal data that we process about you, unless we are required to retain such data to comply with a legal obligation or to establish, exercise or defend legal claims. You may also have the right to request the anonymization, blocking or deletion of unnecessary, excessive or non-conforming personal data.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cstrong>Restriction. \\u003C/strong>You may have the right to request that we restrict our processing of your personal data where:\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003Cul>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>you believe such data to be inaccurate;\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>our processing is unlawful; or\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>we no longer need to process such data for a particular purpose, but where we are not able to delete the data due to a legal or other obligation or because you do not want us to delete it.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cstrong>Portability. \\u003C/strong>You may have the right to request that we transmit the personal data we hold in respect of you to another data controller, where this is:\\u003C/li>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>personal information which you have provided to us; and\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>we are processing that data on the basis of your consent or in order to perform our obligations under contract to you (such as to provide legal services).\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cstrong>Objection: \\u003C/strong>Where the legal justification for our processing of your personal data is our legitimate interest, you may have the right to object to such processing on grounds relating to your particular situation. We will abide by your request unless we have compelling legitimate grounds for the processing which override your interests and rights, or if we need to continue to process the data for the establishment, exercise or defense of a legal claim.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cstrong>Withdrawing Consent:\\u003C/strong> If you have consented to our processing of your personal data, you have the right to withdraw your consent at any time, free of charge. \\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">Further information and advice about your rights can be obtained from the Data Protection Regulator in your Country.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">If you require further information in relation to your privacy rights or would like to exercise any of these rights, please also contact our data protection contact point (see Section 7).\\u003C/p>\\u003Cdiv style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/div>\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"-2px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"45px\",paddingRight:\"50px\",fontSize:\"20px\",marginLeft:\"1px\"}}},{\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",\"@version\":2,id:\"builder-d08d597fe27348bb8b5bcb24149351e9\",meta:{previousId:\"builder-330779b9710c460fae4af72030910bd5\"},component:{name:\"Text\",options:{text:\"\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003Cstrong>7. WHO CAN YOU CONTACT IN CASE YOU HAVE QUESTIONS OR REQUESTS? THE DATA PROTECTION CONTACT POINT\\u003C/strong>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/p>\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"60px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"4