options:{text:\"\\u003Cp>\\u003Col start=\\\"8\\\">\\u003Cli>LINKS TO THIRD-PARTY SITES\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ol>\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/p>\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"60px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"45px\",paddingRight:\"50px\",textDecoration:\"underline\",fontWeight:\"600\",fontSize:\"20px\",fontFamily:\"\\\"Avantt-Bold\\\", sans-serif\"}}},{\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",\"@version\":2,id:\"builder-26d2f89c7fb84deb8e77a57f2b211fe3\",meta:{previousId:\"builder-fd29eff95c6842dab5e252ae65612386\"},component:{name:\"Text\",options:{text:\"\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">We are not responsible for the security or privacy of any information collected by other websites, applications, or other services or by your mobile operating system operator, wireless carrier, or other similar providers. You should exercise caution and review the privacy statements applicable to the third-party websites, applications and services you use.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/p>\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"20px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"45px\",paddingRight:\"50px\",fontSize:\"20px\",marginLeft:\"1px\"}}},{\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",\"@version\":2,id:\"builder-3e8493e7ff5242118d820b7154383bcf\",meta:{previousId:\"builder-22ce40512c22400498f4e222f3064602\"},component:{name:\"Text\",options:{text:\"\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong style=\\\"font-size: 20px;\\\">\\u003Cu>\\u003Col start=\\\"9\\\">\\u003Cli>SECURITY\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ol>\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/u>\\u003C/strong>\\u003C/p>\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"-3px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"45px\",paddingRight:\"50px\",textDecoration:\"underline\",fontWeight:\"600\",fontSize:\"20px\",fontFamily:\"\\\"Avantt-Bold\\\", sans-serif\"}}},{\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",\"@version\":2,id:\"builder-c1733aaf8af248b5918891ab28511c6d\",meta:{previousId:\"builder-2cb7b0ca373c4526bd96c60dec33644b\"},component:{name:\"Text\",options:{text:\"\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">We adopt technical and organizational measures to protect your data as comprehensively as possible. In addition to the commitment of our employees to secrecy and a careful selection and monitoring of our service providers, we also secure our operating environment adequately. To protect your data against unwanted access, we use data encryption. Data collected from this website will be passed between your computer and our server and vice versa via the internet using data encryption in transit technology. If the connection is encrypted the 'lock' symbol on your browser status list will show as locked, and the address line will start with \\\"https://\\\". To have your data secured in transit, we use at least the TLS 1.2 standard (Transport Layer Encryption standard).\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/p>\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"20px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"45px\",paddingRight:\"50px\",fontSize:\"20px\",marginLeft:\"1px\"}}},{\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",\"@version\":2,id:\"builder-2c407fd6312b4c6b9191e2a69b6b5373\",meta:{previousId:\"builder-a92fc39aee4d4714b67d6fbd0cd16407\"},component:{name:\"Text\",options:{text:\"\\u003Cp>\\u003Cspan style=\\\"font-size: inherit;\\\">10. CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY\\u003C/span>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cbr>\\u003Cp>\\u003C/p>\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"19px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"45px\",paddingRight:\"50px\",textDecoration:\"underline\",fontWeight:\"600\",fontSize:\"20px\",fontFamily:\"\\\"Avantt-Bold\\\", sans-serif\"}}},{\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",\"@version\":2,id:\"builder-7e5e15131437455b836405fb517cf518\",meta:{previousId:\"builder-ca0a97c0a11f4d7398977114acad581a\"},component:{name:\"Text\",options:{text:\"\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">EExcept to the extent limited by applicable law, ABI may decide at any time − at its discretion − to change, modify, and/or add all or parts of this Privacy Notice in the future. Any change to this Privacy Notice will be posted on this page and, where required by law and to the extent that we have your e-mail address, notified to you by e-mail. We will indicate at the top of this Privacy Notice the date on which it was last modified.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">Where required by law, we may also ask you to expressly confirm your consent to the modified Privacy and Cookie Notice.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003Cb>Last updated: December 2025 \\u003C/b>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">©2025, Anheuser-Busch InBev\\u003C/p>\\u003Cdiv style=\\\"text-align: justify;\\\">\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cbr>\\u003C/p>\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"20px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"45px\",paddingRight:\"50px\",fontSize:\"20px\",marginLeft:\"1px\"}}},{\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",\"@version\":2,id:\"builder-f9850f08d09d448b86101b3380a2ea07\",meta:{previousId:\"builder-8f6af566756045a7b6866e1e0864db7c\"},component:{name:\"Text\",options:{text:\"\\u003Cp>\\n \\u003Cstrong style=\\\"font-size: 20px;\\\"\\n >\\u003Cu\\n >California Privacy Rights and Supplemental California Privacy Notice\\u003C/u\\n >\\u003C/strong\\n >\\n\\u003C/p>\\n\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"19px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"45px\",paddingRight:\"50px\",textDecoration:\"underline\",fontWeight:\"600\",fontSize:\"20px\",fontFamily:\"\\\"Avantt-Bold\\\", sans-serif\"}}},{\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",\"@version\":2,id:\"builder-5f77c25a18e249759ed78d3a73a99758\",meta:{previousId:\"builder-c724a446f26240d688aaebb404721bf2\"},component:{name:\"Text\",options:{text:\"\\u003Cp>\\n The California Consumer Privacy Act of 2018 (\\\"\\u003Cstrong>CCPA\\u003C/strong>\\\") requires\\n us to provide additional privacy-related information to residents of\\n California.\\n\\u003C/p>\\n\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>CCPA Disclosures\\u003C/strong>\\u003C/p>\\n\\u003Cp>\\n \\u003Cspan style=\\\"font-size: 20px;\\\">The section entitled \\\"\\u003C/span\\n >\\u003Ca\\n href=\\\"https://www.ab-inbev.com/privacy-policy.html#collect\\\"\\n rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\n target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n style=\\\"font-size: 20px;\\\"\\n >What Information We Collect\\u003C/a\\n >\\\" above lists the categories of personal information we have collected about\\n California residents in the preceding 12 months. These categories of personal\\n information correspond with the following categories of personal information\\n provided under the CCPA:\\n\\u003C/p>\\n\\u003Cul>\\n \\u003Cli>\\n Identifiers including name, postal address, unique personal identifier,\\n online identifier, username, IP address, email address and account name;\\n \\u003C/li>\\n \\u003Cli>\\n Information that identifies or is capable of being associated with you,\\n including payment information, social media information, and, if you submit\\n a resume when applying to work for us, information about your employment and\\n employment history;\\n \\u003C/li>\\n \\u003Cli>\\n Information about products or services purchased, obtained, or considered,\\n and other purchasing or consuming histories or tendencies;\\n \\u003C/li>\\n \\u003Cli>Internet or other electronic network activity information;\\u003C/li>\\n \\u003Cli>\\n If you submit a resume when applying to work for us with information about\\n your education, such education information;\\n \\u003C/li>\\n \\u003Cli>\\n Inferences drawn from any of the information identified above reflecting\\n your preferences and characteristics.\\n \\u003C/li>\\n\\u003C/ul>\\n\\u003Cp>\\n The section entitled \\\"\\u003Ca\\n href=\\\"https://www.ab-inbev.com/privacy-policy.html#collectinformation\\\"\\n rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\n target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n style=\\\"font-size: 20px;\\\"\\n >How We Collect Information\\u003C/a\\n >\\\" above lists the sources from which we collect personal information.\\n\\u003C/p>\\n\\u003Cp>\\n The section entitled \\\"\\u003Ca\\n href=\\\"https://www.ab-inbev.com/privacy-policy.html#useinformation\\\"\\n rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\n target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n style=\\\"font-size: 20px;\\\"\\n >How We Use Information\\u003C/a\\n >\\\" above lists the business and commercial purposes for which we collect\\n California residents’ personal information. As described above in the section\\n entitled \\\"How We \\u003Ca\\n href=\\\"https://www.ab-inbev.com/privacy-policy.html#shareinformation\\\"\\n rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\n target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n style=\\\"font-size: 20px;\\\"\\n >Share Your Information\\u003C/a\\n >\\\", we also share and/or disclose your personal information as follows:\\n\\u003C/p>\\n\\u003Cul>\\n \\u003Cli>\\n Sharing your personal information for business purposes: we may share the\\n following categories of your personal information with service providers,\\n third parties, business partners, public or government (including\\n enforcement) authorities, creditors, and successors for our business\\n purposes: identifiers, information capable of being associated with you,\\n information about products and services, internet or other electronic\\n activity information (as described above), information related to job\\n applicants (if submitted), and inferences drawn from information about you.\\n As described above, examples of business purposes include performing\\n transactions, registering accounts, managing our relationship with you, and\\n monitoring for security threats and fraud.\\n \\u003C/li>\\n \\u003Cli>\\n Sharing your personal information for commercial or other purposes: we may\\n share the following categories of your personal information with third\\n parties, business partners, and affiliates in a manner that constitutes a\\n \\\"sale\\\" under California law: identifiers, information capable of being\\n associated with you, information about products and services, internet or\\n other electronic activity information (as described above), information\\n related to job applicants (if submitted), and inferences drawn from\\n information about you. This information may be shared for the following\\n purposes: personalization, analytics, marketing, retargeting, and sales.\\n \\u003C/li>\\n\\u003C/ul>\\n\\u003Cp>\\u003Cstrong>California Residents' Privacy Rights\\u003C/strong>\\u003C/p>\\n\\u003Cp>\\n \\u003Cspan style=\\\"font-size: 20px;\\\"\\n >Subject to certain exceptions and qualifications, as a California resident,\\n you have the right to: (i) request access to your personal information; (ii)\\n request deletion of your personal information; (iii) request information\\n about the personal information about you that we have \\\"sold\\\" (as such term\\n is defined under California law) to third parties within the past 12 months;\\n and (iv) opt-out of the \\\"sale\\\" of your personal information, as detailed\\n above.\\u003C/span\\n >\\n\\u003C/p>\\n\\u003Cul>\\n \\u003Cli>\\n \\u003Cstrong>Do Not Sell My Information.\\u003C/strong> To opt-out of the \\\"sale\\\"\\n of your personal information as described in this section, click \\u003Ca\\n href=\\\"https://www.ab-inbev.com/privacy-policy/california-residents-privacy-rights.html\\\"\\n rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\n target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n >here\\u003C/a\\n >.\\n \\u003C/li>\\n \\u003Cli>\\n \\u003Cstrong>Exercising other California consumer rights.\\u003C/strong> Should\\n you wish to request the exercise of your other rights as detailed above with\\n regard to your personal information, to the extent required by applicable\\n law, we shall respond to your request to exercise your rights above upon\\n your request submitted in to one of the options provided below in the \\\"\\u003Ca\\n href=\\\"https://www.ab-inbev.com/privacy-policy.html#contactus\\\"\\n rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"\\n target=\\\"_blank\\\"\\n >Contact Us\\u003C/a\\n >\\\" section. We may need to take steps, including to request additional\\n information from you, to verify your identity. Please indicate in your\\n request that you are a California resident making a “California privacy\\n rights” inquiry.\\n \\u003C/li>\\n\\u003C/ul>\\n\\u003Cp>\\u003Cbr />\\u003C/p>\\n\"},isRSC:null},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"20px\",lineHeight:\"normal\",height:\"auto\",paddingLeft:\"45px\",paddingRight:\"50px\",fontSize:\"20px\",marginLeft:\"1px\"}}},{\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",\"@version\":2,id:\"builder-9f015695fa0d48288b0efcae6cad0bf0\",meta:{previousId:\"builder-db7fecf89b894281878a2735e58583ed\"},responsiveStyles:{large:{display:\"flex\",flexDirection:\"column\",position:\"relative\",flexShrink:\"0\",boxSizing:\"border-box\",marginTop:\"20px\",height:\"66px\"}}},{id:\"builder-pixel-5vhzochsiwn\",\"@type\":\"@builder.io/sdk:Element\",tagName:\"img\",properties:{src:\"https://cdn.builder.io/api/v1/pixel?apiKey=2e5c7fb02019